WEBVTT

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:36.510
What the future will bring, no man can say.

00:01:37.310 --> 00:01:38.650
But one fact is certain.

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:41.940
Mankind stands at the crucial crossroads of history,

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:45.260
the threshold of a new era, the atomic age.

00:01:45.980 --> 00:01:49.820
For the people of the U.S., skilled in the uses of science and technology,

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:52.940
the atomic age is profoundly significant.

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:56.680
Across a continent, enormous in its agricultural potential,

00:01:57.120 --> 00:01:59.840
Americans have drawn from the earth a rich city.

00:02:00.350 --> 00:02:05.990
have reared towers into the sky have spun intricate networks of highways across the land

00:02:05.990 --> 00:02:12.660
by the application of science industry has grown increasingly productive making possible a good

00:02:12.660 --> 00:02:18.700
way of life with assurance americans look with an abiding faith to the future for many citizen

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:23.940
and scientists alike atomic energy means the promise of a more abundant life but for many

00:02:23.940 --> 00:02:29.960
another the atom is a threat an evil promise the paralyzing panic of our time thus to answer the

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:34.420
perplexing question of the atom and its implications, the people have turned their attention to the

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:40.120
forum of public affairs, have sought to search out realities, to find the facts, or to listen

00:02:40.120 --> 00:02:46.000
to men of science, like Dr. Jeremiah Morley, famed geologist, the embattled founder of the

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:51.900
now defunct society to save civilization. It was Morley who told a Los Angeles audience that

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:59.040
a series of atomic explosions, either accidental or deliberate, could set off a chain reaction to

00:02:59.040 --> 00:02:59.980
annihilate everything.

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:02.660
Every man, woman, and child on the face of the earth.

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:06.600
It could cause the death of every living thing.

00:03:09.170 --> 00:03:12.350
In a gloomy report, Morley took a dim view of history.

00:03:12.910 --> 00:03:18.540
Recall the tragically repetitious story, the decline and fall of all past civilization.

00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:25.490
Said Morley, modern civilization could, by the phenomenon of atomic fission, be brought to dust and ashes.

00:03:26.020 --> 00:03:29.960
For example, if an A-bomb were detonated at the Empire State Building...

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:34.290
The area of total destruction would cover an area of two miles.

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:43.130
Now, since the A-bomb is already obsolete, consider the area of total destruction of an H-bomb.

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:50.150
Alliance has promised us bombs a thousand times more powerful,

00:03:51.470 --> 00:03:55.170
poisoning with radioactivity all the air and water of this Earth.

00:03:56.220 --> 00:03:58.980
This could mean not only the end of our own civilization.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:02.660
but the very possibility of any future civilization.

00:04:03.450 --> 00:04:04.650
What are we going to do about it?

00:04:05.350 --> 00:04:07.130
I'll tell you what I'm going to do about it.

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:12.740
I have a plan, a plan to preserve human life on this planet.

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:16.420
I hope you will join with me in carrying it out.

00:04:22.170 --> 00:04:26.030
The response to Dr. Morley's appeal was immediate and enthusiastic.

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:29.720
The Society to Save Civilization was set up.

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:34.640
To its headquarters, flocked amateur do-gooders and professional scientists.

00:04:35.320 --> 00:04:37.980
From them, Morley chose a staff of experts.

00:04:38.650 --> 00:04:41.610
Dr. Max A. Bauer, eminent geophysicist,

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:45.440
ousted by Hitler from the University of Munich in 1933.

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:49.780
Dr. James Paxton, metallurgical engineer,

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:52.720
twice winner of the McKenna Scientific Award.

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:56.470
Joan Lindsay, medical doctor and ardent feminist,

00:04:56.950 --> 00:04:59.970
who, for her research in biochemistry, was named winner...

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:07.070
of the annual award by the American Confederation of Women Scientists, Dr. George Coleman,

00:05:07.630 --> 00:05:17.550
Authority on Soil Conservation, and Andrew Ostengard, Sandhog, Explosives Expert, Marine

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:19.030
Veteran of World War II.

00:05:19.820 --> 00:05:25.740
It was this team, qualified each in his own way, that helped set in motion Morley's audacious

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:29.900
project, a daringly planned program, which he took three months later.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:32.560
