01:06:39.660 --> 01:06:41.840
I've lived through the terrors of two great wars.

01:06:42.892 --> 01:06:43.592
I've had enough.

01:09:02.330 --> 01:09:03.730
Something's pulling us down.

01:09:57.570 --> 01:09:59.490
We've started, we've been in a blind eye.

01:10:00.670 --> 01:10:03.210
We can't bury ourselves in the earth and expect to leave.

01:10:05.130 --> 01:10:07.430
Maybe that's the small end of...

01:10:08.640 --> 01:10:09.120
Strange.

01:10:10.260 --> 01:10:11.600
We didn't know it before.

01:10:13.980 --> 01:10:15.780
I used to be afraid of death.

01:10:17.770 --> 01:10:18.750
I was afraid of life.

01:13:35.440 --> 01:13:40.880
I think I'll live forever.
